{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15109","headline":"喜邢校书远至对雨同赋远晚饭阮返五韵 · 李益","name":"喜邢校书远至对雨同赋远晚饭阮返五韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雀噪空城阴，木衰羇思远。\n已蔽青山望，徒悲白云晚。\n别离千里风，雨中同一饭。\n开径说逢康，临觞方接阮。\n旅宦竟何如，劳飞思自返。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}